      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh, Slurpuff... You know how I hate seeing you in\na foul mood like this.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nWhy don’t we try to get you your favorite treat?\nWould that make things better?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 280,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 160
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pmff!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 600,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006D0066006600210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hmm. Maybe we can ask this Trainer here for a bit\nof help...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 612,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0048006D006D002E0020004D0061007900620065002000770065002000630061006E002000610073006B0020007400680069007300200054007200610069006E006500720020006800650072006500200066006F0072002000610020006200690074000A006F0066002000680065006C0070002E002E002E001000020114012C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 65
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hi there, stranger. My Slurpuff here is...well, it’s\non strike, you might say. It’s refusing to work.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 744,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 106
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Usually, I can get it feeling perked up in no time\nwith its favorite treat from Café Soleil...but I’m on<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nthe clock, so I can’t head there myself.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 956,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 153
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Do you think you could help out by taking my\nSlurpuff to Café Soleil for me?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nIt isn’t that far—you’ll find it if you head down to\nSouth Boulevard and keep going straight.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1264,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 178
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Please, take my Slurpuff to Café Soleil!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1620,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006C0065006100730065002C002000740061006B00650020006D007900200053006C00750072007000750066006600200074006F002000430061006600E900200053006F006C00650069006C0021001000020114012C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1712,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh, if it isn’t Slurpuff! I see you’ve got a new\nfriend with you today.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nI don’t know where you’ve left poor Meuse, but I\nassume you must want your usual?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1724,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 157
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Thank you for escorting Slurpuff. Please, sit back\nand relax a moment as well.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 2040,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 79
    },
