      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 62
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Puff puff! ♪",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3100,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00500075006600660020007000750066006600210020266A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Looks like you’re back in high spirits! I knew the\nSoleil Sweets Smorgasbord would do the trick!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3128,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 101
    },
    {
      "displayText": "And as thanks for bringing Slurpuff here for me,\nI’ve got a gift for you—some Whipped Dream!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 3332,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "OK, let’s get back to the Shutterbug. We can’t\nleave our own customers waiting, now can we!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 3528,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 96
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Puuuff. ♪",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 3720,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005000750075007500660066002E0020266A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "No matter what setbacks they might have, they go\nright back to being fast friends in a flash...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 3740,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 96
    },
    {
      "displayText": "The relationship between a Trainer and their\nPokémon really is something magical, isn’t it?",
